                    "text": "EXPORT NAME: br.overdrive.1.0~\nMax External Export asks for a name: keep the ~ at the end. Without it the external has the same name as the abstraction br.overdrive.1.0, and Max loads whichever it finds first. Audio Plugin Export (VST3/AU): any name; the Drive, Tight, Tone, Bias, Auto_gain, Level, Dry_Wet and On_Off params appear in your DAW."
